        "AppUITests/ShopUITests/testApplyingDiscountUpdatesTotal": "unaffected"
      },
      "notes": "testFiftyPercentOff isn't in the baseline, so the server never sees it and it isn't on the skip list: it runs. Its row says no_evidence because that is the rule that covers new tests."
